<title>USA: Prairie Du Chien Wis., $1.495 mln won by R.Baird.</title>
<headline>Prairie Du Chien Wis., $1.495 mln won by R.Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert W. Baird said it won $1.495 million of Prairie Du Chien RDA, Wis., redevelopment lease revenue bonds, Series 1996 A, with a net interest cost of 5.42 percent.</p>
